{"seq":1,"slug":"claude-code-hooks-events","title":"Claude Code 事件清单与 5 类 handler","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/coding-tools/hooks/per-tool-hooks/claude-code-hooks-events","wordCount":1386,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"claude-code-事件清单与-5-类-handler\">Claude Code 事件清单与 5 类 handler</h1><p>Claude Code 在 2026 年的 hook 体系是三家工具里最完整的——20+ 个事件覆盖 agent 生命周期几乎每一个可观测节点，5 类 handler 把&quot;用哪种方式响应&quot;的选择面从 shell 扩展到 HTTP / MCP / prompt / sub-agent。本文把事件清单、handler 类型、<code>settings.json</code> 配置范式、以及 skill / subagent frontmatter 内嵌 hook 的局部生效语义讲清。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    EV[事件触发] --&gt; CFG{配置位置}&#10;    CFG --&gt;|~/.claude/settings.json| G[全局生效]&#10;    CFG --&gt;|&lt;project&gt;/.claude/settings.json| P[项目生效]&#10;    CFG --&gt;|skill frontmatter| S[skill 局部生效]&#10;    CFG --&gt;|subagent frontmatter| SA[subagent 局部生效]&#10;    G --&gt; M[matcher 过滤]&#10;    P --&gt; M&#10;    S --&gt; M&#10;    SA --&gt; M&#10;    M --&gt; H{handler 类型}&#10;    H --&gt;|command| CMD[shell 子进程]&#10;    H --&gt;|http| HTTP[HTTP endpoint]&#10;    H --&gt;|mcp_tool| MCP[MCP server tool]&#10;    H --&gt;|prompt| PR[发新 prompt 给 LLM]&#10;    H --&gt;|agent| AG[spawn sub-agent]\">flowchart LR\n    EV[事件触发] --&gt; CFG{配置位置}\n    CFG --&gt;|~/.claude/settings.json| G[全局生效]\n    CFG --&gt;|&lt;project&gt;/.claude/settings.json| P[项目生效]\n    CFG --&gt;|skill frontmatter| S[skill 局部生效]\n    CFG --&gt;|subagent frontmatter| SA[subagent 局部生效]\n    G --&gt; M[matcher 过滤]\n    P --&gt; M\n    S --&gt; M\n    SA --&gt; M\n    M --&gt; H{handler 类型}\n    H --&gt;|command| CMD[shell 子进程]\n    H --&gt;|http| HTTP[HTTP endpoint]\n    H --&gt;|mcp_tool| MCP[MCP server tool]\n    H --&gt;|prompt| PR[发新 prompt 给 LLM]\n    H --&gt;|agent| AG[spawn sub-agent]</pre><p>事件触发后，agent 按&quot;配置位置 → matcher 过滤 → handler 类型&quot;三步定位到具体响应代码。配置位置决定生效范围（全局 / 项目 / skill / subagent），matcher 决定本次事件是否匹配（按工具名、prompt 正则、文件路径等），handler 决定如何执行（5 类 handler 走完全不同的路径）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"18-29-个事件的清单\">18-29 个事件的清单</h2><p>Claude Code 2026 minor 版本在 18-29 个事件之间变动，下表列出主要事件、触发时机、最常见用途：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>主要用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PreToolUse</td>\n<td>工具调用前</td>\n<td>拦截高风险命令、policy enforcement</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PostToolUse</td>\n<td>工具调用后</td>\n<td>校验结果、注入额外评论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UserPromptSubmit</td>\n<td>用户提交 prompt 时</td>\n<td>注入背景、过滤敏感 prompt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UserPromptExpansion</td>\n<td>prompt 被 expand 时</td>\n<td>slash command 扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SessionStart</td>\n<td>会话启动时</td>\n<td>注入 git / CI / 团队 SOP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stop</td>\n<td>agent 试图结束时</td>\n<td>SOP enforcement 强制继续</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SubagentStart</td>\n<td>sub-agent 启动时</td>\n<td>给 sub-agent 注入额外指令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SubagentStop</td>\n<td>sub-agent 结束时</td>\n<td>汇总 sub-agent 输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PreCompact / PostCompact</td>\n<td>上下文压缩前后</td>\n<td>注入&quot;压缩后请记住&quot;提示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WorktreeCreate</td>\n<td>git worktree 创建时</td>\n<td>校验 worktree 命名规范</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FileChanged</td>\n<td>文件被工具修改时</td>\n<td>触发 linter / formatter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CwdChanged</td>\n<td>工作目录变更时</td>\n<td>重新加载环境变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TaskCreated / TaskCompleted</td>\n<td>TaskCreate/Update 工具触发</td>\n<td>同步到外部任务系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PermissionRequest</td>\n<td>权限请求弹窗时</td>\n<td>自动允许 / 拒绝特定权限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PermissionDenied</td>\n<td>权限被拒绝时</td>\n<td>记录审计日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Notification</td>\n<td>通知发送时</td>\n<td>路由到 Slack / 邮件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>事件命名遵守&quot;Pre/Post + 名词&quot;或&quot;动词 + 时态&quot;的模式，新版本主要在补全 lifecycle 缺口（如 v2.0 后新增的 PreCompact / PostCompact、TaskCreated / TaskCompleted）。具体清单以 <code>code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks</code> 最新文档为准——升级 minor 时建议过一遍 release notes 看是否新增可用 hook 点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"5-类-handler\">5 类 handler</h2><p>Claude Code 的 handler 类型决定 hook 实际执行的形态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;hooks&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;PreToolUse&quot;: [&#10;      { &quot;matcher&quot;: &quot;Bash&quot;, &quot;command&quot;: &quot;~/.team/hooks/check-bash.sh&quot; },&#10;      { &quot;matcher&quot;: &quot;Edit&quot;, &quot;handler&quot;: &quot;http&quot;, &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://policy.team.io/hooks/pre&quot; },&#10;      { &quot;matcher&quot;: &quot;Read&quot;, &quot;handler&quot;: &quot;mcp_tool&quot;, &quot;server&quot;: &quot;audit&quot;, &quot;tool&quot;: &quot;log_read&quot; },&#10;      { &quot;matcher&quot;: &quot;.*&quot;, &quot;handler&quot;: &quot;prompt&quot;, &quot;prompt&quot;: &quot;审核当前工具调用是否符合 SOP&quot; },&#10;      { &quot;matcher&quot;: &quot;Write&quot;, &quot;handler&quot;: &quot;agent&quot;, &quot;agent&quot;: &quot;security-reviewer&quot; }&#10;    ]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"hooks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"PreToolUse\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"matcher\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bash\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"command\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"~/.team/hooks/check-bash.sh\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"matcher\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Edit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"handler\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://policy.team.io/hooks/pre\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"matcher\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Read\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"handler\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mcp_tool\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"server\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"audit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"tool\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"log_read\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"matcher\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"handler\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prompt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"prompt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"审核当前工具调用是否符合 SOP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"matcher\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Write\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"handler\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"agent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"agent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"security-reviewer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Handler</th>\n<th>执行形态</th>\n<th>适合场景</th>\n<th>性能预算</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>command</code></td>\n<td>shell 子进程</td>\n<td>简单脚本、本地工具</td>\n<td>&lt;200ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>http</code></td>\n<td>HTTP POST</td>\n<td>团队共享 policy server</td>\n<td>受网络延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>mcp_tool</code></td>\n<td>调用 MCP server tool</td>\n<td>借用已有 MCP 工具能力</td>\n<td>取决于 MCP server</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>prompt</code></td>\n<td>发新 prompt 给同一 LLM</td>\n<td>让 LLM 自审、零额外脚本</td>\n<td>LLM 响应延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>agent</code></td>\n<td>spawn sub-agent 处理</td>\n<td>复杂判断、独立上下文</td>\n<td>sub-agent 启动 + 推理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>prompt</code> handler 是 Claude Code 独有的设计——agent 不去 fork 子进程或 HTTP 请求，而是把 hook 当作&quot;给自己发一条 prompt&quot;处理。这让&quot;用 LLM 审 LLM&quot;成本极低，但代价是延迟和 token 消耗——典型场景是 PostToolUse 触发&quot;检查刚才的 Edit 是否符合代码风格&quot;，让 LLM 自己出诊断。</p>\n<p><code>agent</code> handler 则把工作转给一个独立 sub-agent，常用于安全审查、复杂合规检查——sub-agent 有独立 system prompt、独立上下文、可以并发，不污染主对话。</p>\n<h2 id=\"settings-json-配置范式\">settings.json 配置范式</h2><p><code>~/.claude/settings.json</code> 是全局配置，每个项目可以有自己的 <code>&lt;project&gt;/.claude/settings.json</code> 覆盖或补充。完整配置示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;hooks&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;PreToolUse&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;matcher&quot;: &quot;Bash&quot;,&#10;        &quot;command&quot;: &quot;~/.team/hooks/check-bash-cmd.sh&quot;,&#10;        &quot;timeout_ms&quot;: 2000&#10;      },&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;matcher&quot;: &quot;Edit|Write&quot;,&#10;        &quot;handler&quot;: &quot;http&quot;,&#10;        &quot;url&quot;: &quot;http://localhost:8788/hooks/edit&quot;,&#10;        &quot;timeout_ms&quot;: 3000,&#10;        &quot;on_timeout&quot;: &quot;allow&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;SessionStart&quot;: [{ &quot;command&quot;: &quot;~/.team/hooks/inject-git-status.sh&quot; }],&#10;    &quot;Stop&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;command&quot;: &quot;~/.team/hooks/check-sop-completion.sh&quot;,&#10;        &quot;matcher&quot;: &quot;main-agent&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;UserPromptSubmit&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;matcher&quot;: &quot;^(deploy|release)&quot;,&#10;        &quot;command&quot;: &quot;~/.team/hooks/require-confirmation.sh&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    ]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"hooks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"PreToolUse\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"matcher\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bash\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"command\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"~/.team/hooks/check-bash-cmd.sh\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"timeout_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"matcher\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Edit|Write\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"handler\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http://localhost:8788/hooks/edit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"timeout_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"on_timeout\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"allow\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"SessionStart\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"command\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"~/.team/hooks/inject-git-status.sh\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"Stop\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"command\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"~/.team/hooks/check-sop-completion.sh\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"matcher\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"main-agent\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"UserPromptSubmit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"matcher\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^(deploy|release)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"command\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"~/.team/hooks/require-confirmation.sh\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>字段约定：<code>matcher</code> 是工具名 / prompt 文本的正则；<code>command</code> 是本地脚本绝对路径或 shell 表达式；<code>handler</code> 取 <code>http</code> / <code>mcp_tool</code> / <code>prompt</code> / <code>agent</code> 时填对应字段；<code>timeout_ms</code> 超时；<code>on_timeout</code> 取 <code>allow</code> / <code>deny</code> 决定超时后的兜底行为。</p>\n<p>项目级配置优先级高于全局——同一事件、相同 matcher 的 hook 会按&quot;项目 → 全局&quot;顺序执行，任一返回 exit 2 都阻塞。</p>\n<h2 id=\"skill-subagent-frontmatter-内嵌\">skill / subagent frontmatter 内嵌</h2><p>不希望某条 hook 在所有 session 都生效，只想在特定 skill 或 subagent 工作时生效——这种&quot;局部 hook&quot;通过 frontmatter 内嵌实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"---&#10;name: deploy-helper&#10;description: 部署相关操作的助手 skill&#10;hooks:&#10;  PreToolUse:&#10;    - matcher: &#39;Bash&#39;&#10;      command: &#39;~/.team/hooks/deploy-policy.sh&#39;&#10;  PostToolUse:&#10;    - matcher: &#39;Bash&#39;&#10;      handler: prompt&#10;      prompt: &#39;刚执行的部署命令是否符合 checklist？&#39;&#10;---&#10;&#10;# Deploy Helper&#10;&#10;...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">deploy-helper</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">部署相关操作的助手 skill</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">hooks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  PreToolUse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">matcher</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Bash'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'~/.team/hooks/deploy-policy.sh'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  PostToolUse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">matcher</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Bash'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      handler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">prompt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      prompt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'刚执行的部署命令是否符合 checklist？'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># Deploy Helper</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">...</span></span></code></pre></div><p>内嵌 hook 只在该 skill 被 invoke 期间生效——skill 进入时 agent 注册 hook、skill 退出时撤销。subagent 同理。这一机制让&quot;hook 范围 = skill 范围&quot;，避免一个 deploy-only policy 污染 daily coding session。</p>\n<p>skill / subagent 内嵌 hook 与 settings.json 全局 hook 并存时，两者都会被触发——按&quot;全局 → skill 局部&quot;顺序，任一阻塞均生效；通常局部 hook 会写得更严格（细化 matcher 或加额外检查）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>matcher 写正则却没转义特殊字符</strong>：<code>Bash|Edit</code> 写成 <code>Bash | Edit</code>（带空格）匹配失败；正则按字面理解写。</li>\n<li><strong>timeout 不设兜底</strong>：默认超时为阻塞、整个 agent 卡住；要在 server 不稳时给 <code>on_timeout: &quot;allow&quot;</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>同一事件配多个 command 想&quot;任一通过即放行&quot;</strong>：实际是&quot;任一 exit 2 即阻塞&quot;，AND 逻辑不是 OR；需要 OR 用单个 hook 内自己判断。</li>\n<li><strong>项目 settings.json 与全局冲突</strong>：项目级覆盖语义按字段而非整体（hooks 数组累加），删除全局需写 <code>null</code>。</li>\n<li><strong><code>prompt</code> handler 占用主对话 token</strong>：高频事件配 <code>prompt</code> handler 会快速耗 token；建议配低频事件（Stop / SessionStart 等）。</li>\n<li><strong>skill frontmatter <code>hooks:</code> 拼错字段</strong>：写成 <code>hook:</code> 或 <code>Hooks:</code> 静默不生效，YAML 大小写敏感。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>18-29 个事件覆盖 agent 生命周期，PreToolUse / PostToolUse / SessionStart / Stop 是日常 90% 用途的核心。</li>\n<li>5 类 handler（command / http / mcp_tool / prompt / agent）按延迟 / 复杂度 / 独立性选择；简单 policy 用 command，团队共享用 http，让 LLM 自审用 prompt，复杂判断用 agent。</li>\n<li><code>settings.json</code> 全局 vs 项目级 vs skill/subagent frontmatter 三层配置，按&quot;全局 → 项目 → 局部&quot;叠加生效；任一 exit 2 即阻塞。</li>\n<li>局部 hook 解决&quot;只在某 skill 内严格、其它放宽&quot;的常见需求；通过 frontmatter <code>hooks:</code> 字段配置。</li>\n<li>下一篇 <a href=\"codex-hooks\"><code>2_codex-hooks.md</code></a> 看 Codex 的 6 stable 事件与 admin override 模型。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Claude Code 事件清单与 5 类 handler","id":"claude-code-事件清单与-5-类-handler"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"18-29 个事件的清单","id":"18-29-个事件的清单"},{"level":2,"text":"5 类 handler","id":"5-类-handler"},{"level":2,"text":"settings.json 配置范式","id":"settings-json-配置范式"},{"level":2,"text":"skill / subagent frontmatter 内嵌","id":"skill-subagent-frontmatter-内嵌"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"JSON stdout 结构化控制","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/coding-tools/hooks/hook-trigger-model/json-stdout-structured-control"},"next":{"title":"Codex hooks 与 admin override","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/coding-tools/hooks/per-tool-hooks/codex-hooks"}}